{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And also from the children of the residents.</b> Who came from your surroundings to take wives in your land, and bore children — the child follows the father, and is not included in 'you shall not let live,' but you are permitted to acquire him as a slave (Kiddushin 27)." "<b>From them you may acquire.</b> Them you may acquire."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:27.540489159Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}